{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Couch-Co-op Survival Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box Zombies is a chaotic, easy-to-learn, couch co-op survival game where no two rounds are the same. Explore randomly generated maps, build defenses, and fight off waves of massive zombie hordes with up to 4 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Team up on a single shared screen! The camera keeps everyone in the action \u2014 stick together or risk getting left behind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Stock up on ammo before the round ends, or hope your favorite weapon spawns in the next round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Build defenses with sentry guns, barricades, mines, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlock 20+ characters through in-game challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Experience day/night cycles that shift the pacing and tension</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Learn \u2014 Perfect for Parties</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to gaming? Not a problem.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box Zombies uses <strong>simple controls</strong> designed so anyone, from non-gamers to party guests, can jump in and have fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Box Zombies?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made for Co-Op:</strong> Built from the ground up for split-screen co-op gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Controls:</strong> Simple, intuitive, and beginner-friendly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh Every Time:</strong> Randomized maps, loadouts, powerups, and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great Party Game:</strong> Fast-paced rounds, chaotic fun, and easy drop-in play</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player &amp; local split-screen for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both randomly generated and handcrafted maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls for all skill levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAQ</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: What kind of game is this?</strong> A: A survival sandbox with an emphasis on teamwork, exploration, and simple-yet-chaotic fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Is there online co-op?</strong> A: Not at this time, Box Zombies is designed specifically for same-screen co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Can I turn blood off?</strong> A: Yes! There\u2019s a blood toggle in the Settings menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Is this the same as the mobile game?</strong> A: It shares the name and concept, but this version is almost entirely rewritten to be more stable, polished, and expanded. Stats do not carry over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Note from the Developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out Box Zombies. This game is a spiritual successor to one I loved as a kid, and building it has been a passion project and a huge learning journey. I love reading feedback, ideas, and bug reports, so please feel free to reach out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thanks For Playing!</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Better Together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892230/7af37e18cacb97504ff5a27f1d3a3163d63a4820.jpg"},{"name":"Locked \u2018n Loaded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892230/41e5c2ae7e33c410980a31b5c38054132bea6a14.jpg"},{"name":"Feel the Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892230/fc46814d3a70eea4cf2e07d683e62eab3b87282d.jpg"},{"name":"I Ain\u2