Great Party Game:</strong> Fast-paced rounds, chaotic fun, and easy drop-in play</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player &amp; local split-screen for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both randomly generated and handcrafted maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls for all skill levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAQ</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: What kind of game is this?</strong> A: A survival sandbox with an emphasis on teamwork, exploration, and simple-yet-chaotic fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Is there online co-op?</strong> A: Not at this time, Box Zombies is designed specifically for same-screen co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Can I turn blood off?</strong> A: Yes! There\u2019s a blood toggle in the Settings menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Is this the same as the mobile game?</strong> A: It shares the name and concept, but this version is almost entirely rewritten to be more stable, polished, and expanded. Stats do not carry over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Note from the Developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out Box Zombies. This game is a spiritual successor to one I loved as a kid, and building it has been a passion project and a huge learning journey. I love reading feedback, ideas, and bug reports, so please feel free to reach out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thanks For Playing!</h2>","developers":["TheGreenSquier"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892230/1eebec19816d